OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate death of jailed
OL,4,Asurgeon's patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first criminal investigation has
OL,7,Fbegun into the death of a former
OL,8,Fpatient of the jailed breast surgeon
OL,9,FIan Paterson.
OL,11,FThe deaths of 73 of his patients are
OL,12,Fbeing investigated at inquests to
OL,13,Fdetermine whether or not they died an
OL,14,Funnatural death as a result of his care
OL,15,Fand treatment.
OL,17,FPaterson was jailed for 20 years in
OL,18,F2017 for 17 charges of wounding with
OL,19,Fintent and three of unlawful wounding.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
