OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate death of jailed
OL,4,Asurgeon's patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner Judge Richard Foster has now
OL,7,Freferred the case of Joan Green, 83, to
OL,8,FWest Midlands Police. The force said it
OL,9,Fhad received information from the
OL,10,Fcoroner in August and could now
OL,11,Fconfirm: "This is the first referral
OL,12,Fwe've had as part of these inquests."
